{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Take them now to me and I will bless them</b> — קחם appears once with patach, once with qamatz. תרגלתי לאפרים קחם — meaning: תרגלתי לאפרים, I caused My Shekhinah to rest with him on account of Ephraim. When? At the time he was blessed from the mouth of Jacob, and וקחם על זרועו, as stated: קחם נא אלי ואברכם."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:35.132676171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}